  "notes": [
    "Groups: four groups of four, double round robin, Bo1; the top two advance. Ties are split by head-to-head first; ties still spanning 1st/2nd or 2nd/3rd are played off with Bo1 games, and other ties stay shared (Riot dropped head-to-head before tiebreaker games from 2017). Knockout: 8-team single elimination, Bo5, group winners against runners-up from other groups.",
    "Formats, series lengths, tiebreaker games and placements are verified by replaying the recorded results.",
    "Not modelled: seeding pools in the group draw. Forward simulations draw these randomly; the knockout keeps group mates in opposite halves."
  ],
